    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS A SUPERHERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting genre-mix of Hack and Slash and Third Person Shooter you will play as <strong>Captain Carnage</strong> - a badass superhero - and save the world from various supervillains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AGAINST POWERFUL SUPERVILLAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your personal skill with your heroes superpowers and weapons to beat dreadful supervillains at various locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DARK AND SARCASTIC HUMOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain Carnage</strong> used to be a normal human with an anomalous amount of bad luck. One day he finds himself in the middle of a superhuman fight for a hightech serum. Through a chain of unfortunate events he is injected with the serum and therefore receives his superpowers - increased combat power, increased speed and regenerative ability. Given his new abilities, Captain Carnage joins a shady superhero organisation as a fulltime employee.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARY YOUR PLAYSTYLE AS YOU WISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the entire repertoire of close and ranged attacks to defeat your opponents!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/9d3e457f59d84829d197c0f463207687.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS A SUPERHERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting genre-mix of Hack and Slash and Third Person Shooter you will play as <strong>Captain Carnage</strong> - a badass superhero - and save the world from various supervillains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/6b50dee874154a43501271505b93d53f.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AGAINST POWERFUL SUPERVILLAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your personal skill with your heroes superpowers and weapons to beat dreadful supervillains at various locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/faa6402ce6f746e8c5c301e8c5855f96.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DARK AND SARCASTIC HUMOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain Carnage</strong> used to be a normal human with an anomalous amount of bad luck. One day he finds himself in the middle of a superhuman fight for a hightech serum. Through a chain of unfortunate events he is injected with the serum and therefore receives his superpowers - increased combat power, increased speed and regenerative ability. Given his new abilities, Captain Carnage joins a shady superhero organisation as a fulltime employee.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.poster.avif?t=1748953798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.webm?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240950/extras/97c971f2a5b74ecb7a74b050b15c196d.mp4?t=1748953798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARY YOUR PLAYSTYLE AS YOU WISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the entire repertoire of close and ranged attacks to defeat your opponents!</p>",
